References: <HP2s7zxAsbo.F117SD2eAgAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/geomorph-r-package/c/HP2s7zxAsbo/m/3LHIIcH1AQAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
